// Trader Moss — the shop interior's merchant. "Let's trade" hands off to the
// shop screen, so the conversation ends there.
//
// Also the demo for world flags (npc-dialogue-yarn.md Phase 3): the first visit
// sets met_shopkeeper, and every visit after that gets the returning-customer
// greeting instead — including after a save, quit and reload.

title: greet
---
<<if flag("met_shopkeeper")>>
    <<jump regular>>
<<else>>
    <<jump first_time>>
<<endif>>
===

title: first_time
---
<<set_flag met_shopkeeper>>
$npc: Welcome in. Best prices on the station — care to see my stock?
-> Let's trade
    <<open_shop>>
    <<stop>>
-> Just looking
    <<jump just_looking>>
===

title: regular
---
$npc: Back again. Stock's turned over since you were last in — take a look.
-> Let's trade
    <<open_shop>>
    <<stop>>
-> Just looking
    <<jump just_looking>>
===

title: just_looking
---
$npc: Take your time. Mind the merchandise.
===
